================================================================================

All three are listed in this package's `dependencies` and are marked external
in vite.config.ts, so `dist/plantuml-ts.js` and `dist/plantuml-ts.cjs` import
them at runtime rather than carrying their code. npm installs them alongside
this package, and each reaches the consumer under its own license, from its
own publisher.

